# Service to arm or disarm the UAV.
#
# The request specifies whether to arm or disarm the vehicle. The response
# indicates whether the command was successful and provides a corresponding
# status message.

# Request: Desired arm state.
# arm: true to arm the UAV, false to disarm the UAV.
bool arm

---

# Response: Result of the arm/disarm operation.
# success: true if the operation was successful, false if it failed.
# message: Human-readable information about the status (e.g., success message or error details).
bool success
string message